# SUPERTV-SAMPLE
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
#  SUPER TV - SAMPLE playlist. Replace these with your own channels.
#  Free, legal streams only: official free streams published by the
#  broadcaster, and public test streams. Streams can stop or move at
#  any time; SUPER TV then shows "This channel isn't available".
#
#  Format of each channel (2 lines):
#  #EXTINF:-1 tvg-logo="https://logo-address" group-title="Group",Channel name
#  https://stream-address/index.m3u8
#
#  When you add your own channels, delete the "# SUPERTV-SAMPLE" line
#  above so the "Sample" label goes away.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

